[00:00.01] (I once was a rover on land and on sea
[00:09.13] Till a good woman's love made a new man of me)
[00:20.72] My life had no meaning it was so incomplete
[00:32.43] Till a good woman's love put me back on my feet
[00:43.41] Now stead of roamin' I go home in the evening and she's waiting there
[00:56.34] And I know that no matter what happens she'll always care
[01:07.58] And so when the night falls and the stars shine above
[01:17.00] I'm the man with a dream and a good woman's love
